It's bigger than you, Biboo!

655
00:46:11,872 --> 00:46:14,872
What is that supposed to mean?! I'm bigger than this onion!

656
00:46:14,872 --> 00:46:17,572
This is not a normal-sized onion!

657
00:46:17,572 --> 00:46:20,072
Cucumbers are good for you! Yum!

658
00:46:20,072 --> 00:46:23,572
Now then, let's get going here!

659
00:46:24,572 --> 00:46:27,272
Let me go!

660
00:46:27,272 --> 00:46:29,872
Alright, let me go!

661
00:46:29,872 --> 00:46:31,072
Are you okay?

662
00:46:31,072 --> 00:46:32,872
I'm fine, I'm fine, I'm fine!

663
00:46:33,072 --> 00:46:37,072
Raora's Fate?!
[Title: Raora's Fate?!]

664
00:46:37,872 --> 00:46:41,572
Okay! Are you ready, Raora?

665
00:46:41,572 --> 00:46:44,272
Um, I'm not so sure...

666
00:46:44,272 --> 00:46:48,572
Ah, hey guys, guys, guys! Can we play another game?

667
00:46:49,872 --> 00:46:53,572
Okay! The time limit...

668
00:46:53,572 --> 00:46:57,272
You have to keep dodging for 60 seconds to level up, okay?

669
00:46:57,272 --> 00:46:59,072
Okay, okay, okay, I'm ready.

670
00:46:59,072 --> 00:47:01,072
