671
00:47:01,072 --> 00:47:04,272
So try to escape to the very end without getting hit, okay?

672
00:47:04,272 --> 00:47:05,872
Okay, okay, okay.

673
00:47:05,872 --> 00:47:07,072
Okay then!

674
00:47:07,072 --> 00:47:10,072
GAME START!

675
00:47:10,072 --> 00:47:12,572
I'll do my best!

676
00:47:12,572 --> 00:47:15,572
Wait, wait, wait!

677
00:47:16,072 --> 00:47:18,872
No, no, no, no!

678
00:47:18,872 --> 00:47:22,072
The onion! We can talk about it!

679
00:47:22,072 --> 00:47:24,272
Okay, okay!

680
00:47:24,272 --> 00:47:27,572
No, no, no, no! Email us...

681
00:47:28,572 --> 00:47:30,872
Not the broken spaghetti!

682
00:47:32,072 --> 00:47:33,872
Get away!

683
00:47:33,872 --> 00:47:35,872
Oh my god!

684
00:47:39,272 --> 00:47:41,272
No, no, no, no, no!

685
00:47:41,272 --> 00:47:43,072
Slow down!

686
00:47:46,072 --> 00:47:50,072
Big ball! Big ball!

687
00:47:50,872 --> 00:47:55,572
NOOOOO!

688
00:47:58,072 --> 00:48:01,572
FAILED! You failed!

689
00:48:06,072 --> 00:48:08,572
Do you want to try again?

690
00:48:08,572 --> 00:48:10,572
One more time?

691
00:48:10,572 --> 00:48:13,072
Last time!

692
00:48:13,072 --> 00:48:17,072
Level 1 Revenge!
[Title: Level 1 Revenge!]

693
00:48:17,572 --> 00:48:20,072
How are you feeling?

694
00:48:20,072 --> 00:48:23,072
Maybe we were a bit too hard on her. That was like a long time.

695
00:48:23,072 --> 00:48:25,272
That's not fair...

696
00:48:25,272 --> 00:48:26,572
Okay then...

697
00:48:26,572 --> 00:48:29,872
We're gonna set the clock to 30 seconds. Does that sound more fair?

698
00:48:30,072 --> 00:48:31,872
Okay, let's do it then!

699
00:48:31,872 --> 00:48:34,072
I can definitely make it!

700
00:48:34,072 --> 00:48:36,072
Okay, we're gonna go again!

701
00:48:36,072 --> 00:48:38,272
3, 2, 1...

702
00:48:38,272 --> 00:48:40,572
GAME START!

703
00:48:42,072 --> 00:48:45,072
I'm running, I'm running!

704
00:48:47,072 --> 00:48:50,072
No, no, no! Tell me...

705
00:48:50,072 --> 00:48:53,072
You're doing good! Easy, easy!

706
00:48:55,072 --> 00:48:58,072
No, no, no, no, no!

707
00:49:03,572 --> 00:49:06,072
It's moving so fast!

708
00:49:08,572 --> 00:49:12,072
CLEAR!

709
00:49:12,572 --> 00:49:15,572
Level 1 CLEAR!

710
00:49:15,572 --> 00:49:18,072
You did it!

711
00:49:18,072 --> 00:49:20,072
That's a good deal!

712
00:49:20,072 --> 00:49:22,572
You think you can go all the way?

713
00:49:22,572 --> 00:49:26,072
That was just Level 1, you have Level 2 now!

714
00:49:26,072 --> 00:49:29,072
That was too easy, you know!

715
00:49:30,872 --> 00:49:33,272
Let me try Level 2 then!

716
00:49:33,272 --> 00:49:35,072
You can do it!

717
00:49:35,572 --> 00:49:38,072
It's my first time!

718
00:49:41,272 --> 00:49:43,572
Level 2!

719
00:49:43,572 --> 00:49:46,072
GAME START!

720
00:49:48,572 --> 00:49:52,072
No, no, no, no, no!

721
00:49:56,072 --> 00:49:58,072
You can do it! You have time!

722
00:50:16,880 --> 00:50:22,580
Clear! Level 2 clear!

723
00:50:22,580 --> 00:50:28,080
I did level 2 clear!
I cleared Level 2!

724
00:50:28,580 --> 00:50:32,080
Well, you know, it was pretty easy.

725
00:50:33,580 --> 00:50:36,580
Not falling down or anything, huh?

726
00:50:37,080 --> 00:50:41,080
Well, maybe you didn't put enough effort...

727
00:50:42,080 --> 00:50:46,580
Okay, well, we're gonna make it harder then! Get ready for...

728
00:50:46,580 --> 00:50:50,080
Level 3!

729
00:50:51,080 --> 00:50:54,880
This is the last one! The sticker is mine!

730
00:50:55,080 --> 00:50:58,080
Here we go to the next level!

731
00:50:58,080 --> 00:51:00,580
I think this one's gonna be extra hard!

732
00:51:01,080 --> 00:51:04,080
Because you said that we weren't trying hard, you know what we're gonna do?

733
00:51:04,580 --> 00:51:10,580
We're gonna make this one... You only have one try!

734
00:51:11,080 --> 00:51:12,880
Oh, come on!

735
00:51:13,080 --> 00:51:15,580
And you know what? That's not all! It's gonna be extra hard!

736
00:51:16,580 --> 00:51:19,580
This is really not fair at all!

737
00:51:19,580 --> 00:51:23,580
You guys are cheating! This is not fair!

738
00:51:23,580 --> 00:51:26,580
You are so evil!

739
00:51:28,080 --> 00:51:30,080
Level 3!

740
00:51:30,880 --> 00:51:33,080
Game start!

741
00:52:06,080 --> 00:52:09,580
Failed!

742
00:52:10,580 --> 00:52:13,580
I don't think she's gonna be able to come back from that.

743
00:52:14,080 --> 00:52:17,580
It's over! Bye-bye!

744
00:52:26,580 --> 00:52:29,580
Yoshi yoshi, it's okay!
There, there, it's okay!

745
00:52:37,580 --> 00:52:41,580
Yoshi yoshi yoshi...
There, there, there...

746
00:52:44,580 --> 00:52:49,080
Well, you know, guys... Today is my 3D debut, right?

747
00:52:49,580 --> 00:52:55,580
