748
00:52:56,080 --> 00:52:58,080
No.

749
00:52:58,080 --> 00:53:00,080
No! No! No!

750
00:53:00,080 --> 00:53:03,580
You're so mean!

751
00:53:04,080 --> 00:53:06,080
I'm not getting the sticker?!

752
00:53:06,580 --> 00:53:09,580
No sticker for you! Sorry!

753
00:53:10,080 --> 00:53:13,580
But Raora, we have prepared a special stage for you!

754
00:53:13,580 --> 00:53:15,080
Ah, really?!

755
00:53:15,580 --> 00:53:22,080
Well, while it was fun torturing you with things you hate...

756
00:53:23,080 --> 00:53:25,580
We kind of want to see your cool side!

757
00:53:25,580 --> 00:53:27,580
My cool side?

758
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:31,080
Yeah, your cool side! Show it off to everyone!

759
00:53:31,580 --> 00:53:36,080
Maybe you can put all those angry feelings into the next song!

760
00:53:36,580 --> 00:53:38,080
Yeah, sing!

761
00:53:38,080 --> 00:53:39,580
Okay!

762
00:53:40,080 --> 00:53:44,080
Go, go, go, go, go!

763
00:53:52,580 --> 00:53:58,080
恋は戦争
Love is War

764
00:54:03,280 --> 00:54:07,280
もう行き場がないわ
There's nowhere for it to go anymore

765
00:54:07,580 --> 00:54:13,080
この恋の熱量
The heat of this love

766
00:54:47,080 --> 00:54:51,080
灰色の雲
The grey clouds

767
00:54:51,280 --> 00:54:57,280
モノクロの喧騒
The monochrome clamor

768
00:54:57,580 --> 00:55:00,080
日差しはかげり
The sunlight casts a shadow

769
00:55:00,088 --> 00:55:01,888
日差しはかげり
The sunlight casts a shadow

770
00:55:01,888 --> 00:55:08,088
夕暮れは色を変えていく
The twilight changes color

771
00:55:08,088 --> 00:55:13,288
嗚呼 世界がにじんで
Ah, the world blurs

772
00:55:13,288 --> 00:55:19,088
それでも好きでいられるかなんて
Even so, can I keep loving you?

773
00:55:19,088 --> 00:55:24,588
わかってる けどどうすればいいの
I know, but what should I do?

774
00:55:24,588 --> 00:55:29,888
どうしたら どうすれば
What can I do? What should I do?

775
00:55:29,888 --> 00:55:32,888
バカだな わたし...
I'm such a fool...

776
00:55:32,888 --> 00:55:39,588
始めるのよ これは戦争
I'm starting this—it's war!

777
00:55:39,588 --> 00:55:44,588
嬉しそうなキミをみるなんて
Seeing you look so happy...

778
00:55:44,588 --> 00:55:49,888
切なる恋 それは罪
An earnest love, that is a sin

779
00:55:49,888 --> 00:55:56,088
見せてあげる わたしの想いを
I'll show you my feelings

780
00:56:06,588 --> 00:56:17,088
叫んでみたメガホンは壊れてたの
The megaphone I tried shouting into was broken

781
00:56:17,088 --> 00:56:27,588
どれだけ背伸びしたって 君の視界に入らない
No matter how much I stand on tiptoe, I don't enter your sight

782
00:56:27,588 --> 00:56:35,888
嗚呼 いつの間にか晴れた空
Ah, before I knew it, the sky cleared up

783
00:56:35,888 --> 00:56:38,888
全然似合わない
It doesn't suit me at all

784
00:56:38,888 --> 00:56:44,088
気持ちが抑えられなくて
I can't suppress my feelings

785
00:56:44,088 --> 00:56:48,888
どうしたら どうすれば
What can I do? What should I do?

786
00:56:48,888 --> 00:56:55,588
泣いてなんか ないんだからね
It's not like I'm crying or anything

787
00:56:55,588 --> 00:56:57,888
大好き
I love you

788
00:56:57,888 --> 00:57:04,588
たたかうのよ ハートを撃て
I will fight! Shoot for the heart!

789
00:57:04,588 --> 00:57:09,088
手段なんて選んでられない
I can't afford to choose my means

790
00:57:09,088 --> 00:57:14,588
スカート ひらり 見せつけるのよ
With a flutter of my skirt, I'll show off

791
00:57:14,588 --> 00:57:22,588
君の視線 奪ってみせるの
I'll steal your gaze away

792
00:57:22,588 --> 00:57:25,588
迎撃用意
Prepare for counterattack

793
00:57:25,588 --> 00:57:31,588
戦況は未だ不利なのです
The battle situation is still unfavorable

794
00:57:31,588 --> 00:57:37,088
恋は盲目
Love is blind

