804
00:58:33,288 --> 00:58:36,588
Uh-uh, let me tell you.

805
00:58:41,088 --> 00:58:45,588
That's the best! It's not a jetpack, but it's really nice!

806
00:58:45,588 --> 00:58:47,888
Thanks, Chattini!

807
00:58:47,888 --> 00:58:55,588
Well then, before I reveal the best present ever, I've got an announcement to make!

808
00:58:55,588 --> 00:58:57,288
Tada!

809
00:58:57,288 --> 00:59:02,088
Raora pencil case & keychain!

810
00:59:02,088 --> 00:59:08,088
Yes! This is a cute pencil case with me in a Chattino costume!

811
00:59:08,088 --> 00:59:16,088
So I hope you guys can bring it everywhere: at school, in the office...

812
00:59:16,088 --> 00:59:20,588
...literally everywhere! So please don't miss out, okay?

813
00:59:21,088 --> 00:59:27,088
That was such a fun 3D showcase with a lot of things happening!

814
00:59:27,088 --> 00:59:32,088
Did everyone have fun? Chattini, did you guys have fun?

815
00:59:33,088 --> 00:59:39,588
Thank you! I'm so happy to hear that!

816
00:59:39,588 --> 00:59:44,888
Thank you! Seems like you guys had a great time with me today. I'm so happy, thank you!

817
00:59:44,888 --> 00:59:52,088
I'll keep doing my best to bring fun streams and more 3D live performances like this one today, okay?

818
00:59:52,088 --> 00:59:58,588
I appreciate you guys so much. Thank you, Chattini, for all your support! Thank you, thank you, thank you!

