822
01:00:12,896 --> 01:00:18,596
my first original song!

823
01:00:21,096 --> 01:00:23,896
Ah, I'm so happy!

824
01:00:24,096 --> 01:00:28,596
It's full of things I like, and so many personal touches!

825
01:00:29,096 --> 01:00:34,596
I worked really, really hard on this song, so I hope you guys are gonna take a listen to it, okay?

826
01:00:35,096 --> 01:00:37,896
Are you guys ready? Are you guys excited?

827
01:00:38,096 --> 01:00:40,896
Let's go to the stage!

828
01:00:50,096 --> 01:00:53,096
Gacha × Gacha ADVENTURE!

829
01:00:53,896 --> 01:00:58,896
