「目指せコンプリート！」
"Aiming for complete!"

845
01:01:41,296 --> 01:01:44,096
さあ、もう一回 止めても無駄だよ♪
Now, one more time! Stopping me is useless♪

846
01:01:44,096 --> 01:01:47,096
もう一回 繰り返すデジャブ
One more time, repeating déjà vu,

847
01:01:47,096 --> 01:01:49,096
諦めろって言わないで
don't tell me to give up!

848
01:01:49,096 --> 01:01:52,096
三度目の正直
Third time's the charm,

849
01:01:52,096 --> 01:01:58,096
だから無問題 溢れる想いがとめらんない これって天職！？
so no problem! Overflowing feelings can't be stopped, is this my calling?!

850
01:01:58,096 --> 01:02:03,296
楽しいことで満ちてる この先もずっと
Filled with fun things, from now on and forever!

851
01:02:03,296 --> 01:02:04,296
「はい、せーのっ」
"Okay, ready, go!"

852
01:02:04,296 --> 01:02:06,596
Gacha × Gacha ADVENTURE!

853
01:02:06,596 --> 01:02:08,096
