860
01:02:22,596 --> 01:02:25,596
ビートに乗ったら止まれないの〜
Once I ride the beat, I can't stop~

861
01:02:25,596 --> 01:02:28,096
音ゲーもお手製のもの
Rhythm games are easy peasy,

862
01:02:28,096 --> 01:02:31,596
ComboもFeverも全部 キメタラ完璧 Groove!
Combo, Fever, everything, nail it all for a perfect Groove!

863
01:02:31,596 --> 01:02:32,296
ズレたらゲームオーバーさ
If you slip, it's game over!

864
01:02:32,296 --> 01:02:33,296
