ねぇねぇ、もうバイバイしなきゃダメ？
Hey hey, do we really have to say bye-bye?

874
01:03:01,096 --> 01:03:04,596
まだ帰りたくない これって恋かな！？
I don't want to go home yet, is this love?!

875
01:03:04,596 --> 01:03:10,096
ワクワクで満ち溢れた この先の日々も
Full of excitement, all the days ahead as well,

876
01:03:10,096 --> 01:03:11,896
「一緒に冒険しよう！」
"Let me go on an adventure together!"

877
01:03:11,896 --> 01:03:14,296
さあ、もう一回 止めても無駄だよ♪
Now, one more time! Stopping me is useless♪

878
01:03:14,296 --> 01:03:17,096
もう一回 繰り返すデジャブ
One more time, repeating déjà vu,

879
01:03:17,096 --> 01:03:19,096
諦めろって言わないで
don't tell me to give up!

880
01:03:19,096 --> 01:03:22,096
何度でもチャレンジ
Challenge as many times as it takes!

881
01:03:22,096 --> 01:03:27,596
だから無問題 溢れる想いが とめらんない これぞ天職！！
So no problem! Overflowing feelings can't be stopped, this is my true calling!!

882
01:03:27,596 --> 01:03:30,896
何度でもやり直せる
You can restart as many times as you want,

883
01:03:30,896 --> 01:03:33,296
そう人生は
that's right, life is—

884
01:03:33,296 --> 01:03:34,296
(みんなも一緒に！)
(Everyone together!)

885
01:03:34,296 --> 01:03:36,896
Gacha × Gacha ADVENTURE!

886
01:03:37,096 --> 01:03:42,596
(はい！ はい！ はい！ Pon! Pon!)
(Yes! Yes! Yes! Pon! Pon!)

887
01:03:42,896 --> 01:03:46,096
(Gacha, Gacha, RAOOOOO!!)

888
01:03:46,096 --> 01:03:50,096
「また一緒に冒険しようね！ Ciao ciao♪」
"Let's go on an adventure together again! Ciao ciao♪"

889
01:04:00,096 --> 01:04:06,096
That was so much fun!

890
01:04:06,296 --> 01:04:10,896
How did you like it, Chattini? Did you like it?

891
01:04:11,596 --> 01:04:16,096
Thank you for watching and listening!

892
01:04:16,296 --> 01:04:20,596
Today was so much fun! Thank you so much everyone for all your support!

893
01:04:20,896 --> 01:04:23,596
Thank you, Chattini, thank you!

894
01:04:24,096 --> 01:04:28,096
I can't wait to see you all again!

895
01:04:28,296 --> 01:04:33,296
Until next time, ciao ciao!

896
01:04:33,596 --> 01:04:36,596
Raoooo~!

897
01:04:37,596 --> 01:04:40,096
BIG CAT MEANS...

898
01:04:40,296 --> 01:04:44,096
BIG DREAMS!

